      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "已知:"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "H2S 水溶液的酸式解离常数:$K_{a1} = 1.1 \\times 10^{-7}$,$K_{a2} = 1.3 \\times 10^{-13}$"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "ZnS 的溶度积常数:$K_{sp} = 2.5 \\times 10^{-22}$"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "CuS 的溶度积常数:$K_{sp} = 6.3 \\times 10^{-36}$"
    },
    {
      "type": "callout",
      "tone": "info",
      "text": "(原卷此处含表格/仪器试剂表,详见 PDF 或 MD 源文件。)"
    }
  ],
  "parts": [
    {
      "id": "part-000441-01",
      "label": "3-1",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "ZnS 可以溶于稀盐酸,反应式为:"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "$$\\ce{ZnS + 2H+ <=> Zn^{2+} + H2S}$$"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "拟将 0.010 mol ZnS 溶于 1 升盐酸中,求所需盐酸的最低浓度。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "part-000441-02",
      "label": "3-2",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "CuS 可以溶于 $\\ce{HNO3}$,反应式为:"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "$$\\ce{3CuS + 2NO3^- + 8H+ <=> 3Cu^{2+} + 2NO + 3S + 4H2O}$$"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "求该反应的平衡常数 $K^{\\ominus}$。"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
